sa --> SAFR004 : "Configure Analysis Parameters by Client Segment"
client --> CFR003 : "View Financial Predictions Based on Data and Trends" (via AIFR001)
AIFR002 <|-- client
Client --> CFR005 : "Manage Preferences for Personalized Recommendations" 
fa --> FAFR004: "Identify Investments Based on User's Risk Tolerance"
client --> SFR019 : "Maintain Historical Record of Insights" (via AIFR008)
AIFR007 <|-- client
Client --> CFR006 : "View Spending Limit Alerts When Exceeding Thresholds" 
AIFR003 <|-- client
client --> SFR012: "Generate Client Dashboards for Financial Information"
sa --> SAFR004: "Configure Analysis Parameters by Segment"
fa --> FAFR005: "Identify Investments Based on Strategies and MPT Principles"
